    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793070/extras/a0fdf95847e158a5e071534747388293.avif?t=1707402301\" width=700 height=332 /></span><br><br>Meet Jaimie, the sassy and tech-savvy e-girl who's always on top of the latest trends. Living in the heart of the city, she spends her free time exploring the buzzing nightlife, rollerblading and immersing herself in the world of video games. With her sharp wit and quick mind, Jaimie always has something interesting to say and loves engaging in thought-provoking conversations. When she's not gaming or socializing, you'll find her tinkering with her gadgets, always eager to learn more about the latest tech innovations. Spending time with Jaimie is an exciting adventure that you won't want to miss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793070/extras/17cb1ec0eae091c1fe6c6eb219199cd0.avif?t=1707402301\" width=700 height=300 /></span><br><br>Meet Emma, the shy and solitary country girl who finds solace in the serene beauty of the snowy forest. Living a simple life surrounded by nature, she spends most of her days taking long hikes, enjoying the hot springs, and exploring the breathtaking countryside. Emma is a quiet observer, content to soak in the stillness and appreciate the small wonders of the natural world. Despite her reserved nature, Emma has a kind heart and a gentle spirit, and she cherishes the few close relationships she has. Spending time with Emma means experiencing the peacefulness and tranquility of a life lived in harmony with nature.<br><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High Quality Puzzles<br></li><li>Casual One Handed Gameplay ;)<br></li><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul>",
